# Cloudflare Pages. Every public page has its own written HTML file; any other address gets 404.html with a real 404
# status (written by the build: the app shell, noindex, showing "Page not found").
#
# Client-only pages, private to each visitor or reviewer, have no written file: they load that same noindex shell with
# a 200, and the app opens the page.
/workspace     /404.html  200
/data-quality  /404.html  200
# Old addresses the app used to redirect itself.
/history       /monthly-trends            301
/intelligence  /intelligence/production   301
